set_option linter.style.longLine false

/-!
# `F₄` Lie data tables: the invariant form, the dual family, the columns

In the `f4T` basis: `f4Gm = Killing/18` (long roots of length `2`; integer entries), the dual family
`dⱼ = (1/Dⱼ) vec (f4dl j)`, the adjoint Casimir `2h = 18` (`h = 9`). Generated outside Lean
(from the table; untrusted, re-checked in `F4LieChecks*`).
-/

